---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cyberpunk 2077 — Cross-Platform Buying Guide"
  description="Cyberpunk 2077 buying guide: the Ultimate Edition, Phantom Liberty, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Cyberpunk 2077 — Cross-Platform Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">Xbox / PS5 / PC · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Cyberpunk 2077</strong> is CD Projekt Red's open-world RPG that was rebuilt
      by the acclaimed <em>Phantom Liberty</em> expansion and the 2.0 update into one of
      the best comeback stories in gaming.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Ultimate Edition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Ultimate Edition</strong> — bundles the base game + Phantom Liberty; this is the one to buy</li>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — base game only; you'd pay extra for Phantom Liberty separately</li>
      <li><strong>Next-gen update</strong> — free for existing owners; PS5/Xbox Series get the polished version</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      Cyberpunk sees deep, steady discounts. Green Man Gaming's key price undercuts the
      console stores and physical discs, and a digital key means no disc swapping. On PC,
      compare against Steam sales.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=cyberpunk+2077"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Cyberpunk+2077"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
